{"nodes": [{"id": "src_ui_index_pearcast_look", "label": "Pearcast look (dark, one green accent, depth from light)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/ui/index.html", "source_location": "style :root", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CSS tokens: dark surfaces, soft top highlights and long shadows, one green accent and one red; color-scheme dark; a single-file GUI with no framework."}, {"id": "src_ui_index_event_stream", "label": "EventSource /api/events push stream", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/ui/index.html", "source_location": "line 1342", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The daemon pushes every change; the page never polls. If the stream is quiet for a minute, one catch-up load then back to the stream. Events: rooms, room, record, participants, reactions, activity, agent-error, login-progress, login, fork, file-progress."}, {"id": "src_ui_index_api", "label": "api() fetch helper and REST surface", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/ui/index.html", "source_location": "line 621", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Endpoints used: /api/state, /api/send, /api/control, /api/react, /api/redact, /api/rooms(+join/add), /api/invite, /api/request, /api/approve, /api/revoke, /api/unban, /api/people, /api/glossary(+learn), /api/settings, /api/remote(+enable/pair/revoke), /api/login/offer|claim, /api/files, /api/fetch, /api/file, /api/blob, /api/upload, /api/activity."}, {"id": "src_ui_index_load", "label": "load(topic): fetch /api/state and renderAll", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/ui/index.html", "source_location": "line 630", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_ui_index_renderfeed", "label": "renderFeed (timeline bubbles, day lines, control lines, redactions)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/ui/index.html", "source_location": "line 651", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Computes a signature of visible state and skips repaint when nothing changed so the reader stays where they are; keeps distance-from-bottom when re-rendering mid-read; continuation grouping within 5 minutes by the same author."}, {"id": "src_ui_index_renderpanel", "label": "renderPanel / PAGES table / openPage", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/ui/index.html", "source_location": "line 924, 998, 1003", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pages: rooms, people, room, contacts, profile, agents, keys (Verified), activity, invite, settings. Never repaints the room page under an unsaved charter edit or mid-drag. On the phone a tab strip sits on top of the sheet."}, {"id": "src_ui_index_renderroompage", "label": "renderRoomPage (room details: people/agents, key rows, remove/ban/unban, charter order)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/ui/index.html", "source_location": "line 1075", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_ui_index_renderprofilepage", "label": "renderProfilePage (root, device, signing tree, hosted agents, log in new device QR, approve request)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/ui/index.html", "source_location": "line 1167", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One account, a key per device, all shown as you; the root lives on this Mac for now and moves to an NFC card later."}, {"id": "src_ui_index_renderagentspage", "label": "renderAgentsPage (budget, pause, limits)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/ui/index.html", "source_location": "line 1191", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_ui_index_renderkeyspage", "label": "renderKeysPage (Verified: signature details, voice memo transcrip